# Markdown is deliberately NOT formatted by Prettier.
#
# In this repository the prose is a deliverable, not a by-product: COMPLIANCE.md, docs/problems.md
# and the README carry the reasoning the code cannot. Prettier pads every markdown table to the
# width of its longest cell, which pushes tables far past 100 columns and makes them painful to
# edit, and it reflows the JSON inside fenced blocks, undoing examples that were laid out compactly
# on purpose. Neither is worth it for prose that is already hand-wrapped to 100 columns.
#
# The convention is documented in CONTRIBUTING.md "Style" instead, and reviewed rather than
# enforced by a tool.
*.md
